    <para id="para-00086">Brown, B. B. (2004). Adolescents’ relationships with peers. In R. M. Lerner &amp; L. Steinberg (Eds.), <emphasis effect="italics">Handbook of Adolescent Psychology</emphasis> (2nd ed., pp. 363–394. John Wiley &amp; Sons. https://psycnet.apa.org/record/2004-12826-011</para>
